# oracle: fix gcmc with the pressure and fugacity_coeff keywords in units lj, interacting LJ atoms with translations: the activity is P phi / (k_B T) (mu is ignored), and accept/reject decisions, positions and velocities follow native's random streams
# oracle-compare: thermo=all atoms=all rel=1e-8
units lj
atom_style atomic
pair_style lj/cut 2.5
pair_modify tail no
region box block 0 6 0 6 0 6
create_box 1 box
pair_coeff * * 1.0 1.0
mass 1 1.0
group gcmcgroup type 1
fix mygcmc gcmcgroup gcmc 1 4 4 1 29494 1.5 99.0 0.3 pressure 0.15 fugacity_coeff 0.8
compute k all ke/atom
compute ks all reduce sum c_k
thermo_style custom step atoms pe c_ks f_mygcmc[1] f_mygcmc[2] f_mygcmc[3] f_mygcmc[4] f_mygcmc[5] f_mygcmc[6]
thermo 5
thermo_modify format float %.15g
run 120
